{"about_the_game":"In order to achieve our dreams of entering the 2nd dimension, we will be working together with the original creators of Spice and Wolf to create a VR animation.<br />\r\nAnime will evolve from something that is \u201cseen\u201d to something that is \u201cexperienced\u201d...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Story-<br />\r\nKraft Lawrence is a traveling merchant who meets Holo, a beautiful woman who can transform into a wolf. <br />\r\nAs they travel together they face many hardships, such as having to walk in the rain.<br />\r\nIn order to avoid the sudden downpour, Holo and Lawrence take shelter in an old, abandoned water mill in the woods.<br />\r\nThey huddle around a small fire and enjoy a slightly strange but relaxing time together.<br />\r\nYou are able to share that time together with them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProduction Staff<br />\r\nScenario: Isuna Hasekura<br />\r\nCharacter Design: Ju Ayakura<br />\r\nHolo\u2019s CV: Ami Koshimizu<br />\r\nKraft Lawrence\u2019s CV: Jun Fukuyama<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEven if you do not have a VR headset, you can enjoy anime and mini games in non-VR mode.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c1814dbbf02be5c7dbf421c5c6c2ddccb575542a.jpg","localized_name":"Time Spent Together","name":"Time Spent Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1065970/c1814dbbf02be5c7dbf421c5c6c2ddccb575542a.jpg"},{"icon":"d98b9d8e8e5dddfc9df80ce61c73ec2804518042.jpg","localized_name":"Play with Me","name":"Play with Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1065970/d98b9d8e8e5dddfc9df80ce61c73ec2804518042.jpg"},{"icon":"d98b9d8e8e5dddfc9df80ce61c73ec2804518042.jpg","localized_name":"Guide Map","name":"Guide Map","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1065970/d98b9d8e8e5dddfc9df80ce61c73ec2804518042.jpg"},{"icon":"7f3b9005a03607f2911e1221b007f8427d7679fb.jpg","localized_name":"One Step at a Time","name":"One Step at a Time